%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('beggar_helped')
goto: Thankful

cond: true
goto: Begging

%rec: Nodes
%type: npc multiline

name: Begging
npc: (A hunched man in a soaked blanket rattles a cup with a few coins in it.)
+ Spare some sat, choomba? Anything helps.
#
o_text: Here, take 5 sat.
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 5)
o_goto: GiveSmall
#
o_text: Here, take 50 sat. Get yourself something warm.
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 50)
o_goto: GiveBig
#
o_text: Sorry, not today.
o_goto: Goodbye

name: GiveSmall
npc: (He nods and pockets the coins.) Thanks. You're alright.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 5)
effect: SetFlag('beggar_helped')
effect: EndConversation

name: GiveBig
npc: (He stares at the money, then at you.) That's... more than I see in a week.
+ Bless you, choomba. I won't forget this.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 50)
effect: SetFlag('beggar_helped')
effect: EndConversation

name: Thankful
npc: Hey, it's you again. Still alive out here, thanks to you.
#
o_text: Take care.
o_goto: Goodbye

name: Goodbye
npc: (He goes back to rattling his cup.)
effect: EndConversation
